Also, if $8 < x \le 16,$ then $x - 8 \le \frac{x^2}{8},$ so
\[\frac{x^2}{x - 8} \ge 8,\]and we cannot choose equality either.

Therefore, we can't achieve equality in either AM-GM, so we should look for another approach.  Express $\frac{x^2}{x - 8}$ as a sum.
